  {
   "title": "Vue2里data覆盖同名computed属性",
   "type": "bug",
   "content": "`table.js` mixin定义`data.selectable: true`，Vue2中与同名`computed`冲突时以`data`为准，导致`v-if=\"selectable\"`恒真。移除computed的`selectable`，在组件`data()`声明`selectable: !this.isChange`以控制多选列渲染。",
   "evidence": "src=苏州市房地产监测V3-rest/052.md",
